  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "A `builds` resource represents a single build of an app. You must upload builds using Xcode, Transporter, or the `build-uploads` resource. Once App Store Connect processes the build, it appears as a build resource.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/build-uploads"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once the build is in the system, you can use the API to perform actions like:",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Submitting builds for review.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Individually assigning builds to testers.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Adding the build to a beta group for testing.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
